{"id":7709,"date":"2021-08-30T09:33:04","date_gmt":"2021-08-30T13:33:04","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=7709"},"modified":"2021-08-30T09:33:04","modified_gmt":"2021-08-30T13:33:04","slug":"our-trek-west-installment-one","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2021\/08\/30\/our-trek-west-installment-one\/","title":{"rendered":"Our Trek West (Installment One)"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>We left Ohio on August 20th after finishing up my hip replacement rehab.  Our first stop was about 5 hours north to Romeo, Michigan to attend Kathy&#8217;s niece Lindsey&#8217;s wedding reception.  The wedding was last year, but it was a small event with no reception because of Covid.  The reception was a bright (and humid) Saturday late afternoon gathering under one of those huge white tents in the large back yard of her new husband&#8217;s parent&#8217;s home.  There were about 100 people attending and we had the wonderful opportunity to visit with some of Kathy&#8217;s family that we hadn&#8217;t seen in years and meet some new folks as well.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We stayed 2 nights at Addison Oaks Campground, part of the Oakland County Michigan Parks and Rec.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210821_075444742.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210821_075444742.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7711\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210821_075444742.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210821_075444742-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210821_075444742-685x386.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a><figcaption>Our camp site at Addison Oaks, about 10 miles from Lindsey&#8217;s wedding reception<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>When we arrived at Addison Oaks the first night we went on into Romeo for a walk up and down the main drag.  This was the first night of the big annual &#8220;Dream Cruise&#8221; up and down Woodward Avenue and we got to see some of those cool classic cars from years gone by that were traveling to or from the cruise.  While in Romeo we had a great meal out on the front patio at &#8220;Thee Office Pub&#8221;.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210820_193419021.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210820_193419021.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7712\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210820_193419021.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210820_193419021-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210820_193419021-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption>Beer Battered Cod, Mac N Cheese, and creamy Cole Slaw at &#8220;Thee Office Pub&#8221; Romeo Michigan<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Sunday morning after the reception, we continued our trip west and moved on to the Shiawassee County Fairgrounds.  We were able to spend a couple super quiet nights (we were one of two campers) while visiting my sisters and their husbands at Owosso, Michigan.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-2 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210822_111717484-1.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210822_111717484-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7714\" class=\"wp-image-7714\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210822_111717484-1.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210822_111717484-1-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210822_111717484-1-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Our campsite at the fairgrounds<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210822_111646963.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210822_111646963.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7715\" class=\"wp-image-7715\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210822_111646963.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210822_111646963-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210822_111646963-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The only other camper there<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Betsy and Bob live on the north side of Owosso.  They moved there last year after living on St. John U.S. Virgin Islands for about 10 years.  Their son and only granddaughter live within about an hour and B&amp;B are able to see her often.  Sometimes she spends the night and she (Kaia) was there when we visited.  Marilynn and Rick drove up from Jacksonville Florida for our time together.  We had a great time sharing stories from years past and getting updates on everybody&#8217;s health and welfare.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"393\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210823_201345887.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7716\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7716\" class=\"wp-image-7716\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210823_201345887.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210823_201345887-300x155.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210823_201345887-685x354.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Herb, Marilynn, &amp; Betsy<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210823_201012485.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7717\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7717\" class=\"wp-image-7717\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210823_201012485.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210823_201012485-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210823_201012485-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Rick &amp; Marilynn<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210823_201107424.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7719\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7719\" class=\"wp-image-7719\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210823_201107424.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210823_201107424-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210823_201107424-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Betsy &amp; Bob<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210823_201028134_MP.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7718\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7718\" class=\"wp-image-7718\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210823_201028134_MP.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210823_201028134_MP-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/IMG_20210823_201028134_MP-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Just had to add this &#8211; yes, Bob IS smiling!<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>On Monday night we said our goodbyes, went back to the fairgrounds and pulled out Tuesday morning heading for Baldwin Michigan where we would spend a couple days\/nights visiting our friends at<a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/08\/13\/workamping-at-pere-marquette-rv-park-baldwin-mich\/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"4003\"> Pere Marquette Oaks RV Resort<\/a> where we worked as Park Supervisors the summers of 2017 and 2018.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>And that&#8217;s where the problems started &#8230; more on that in my next post.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We left Ohio on August 20th after finishing up my hip replacement rehab. Our first stop was about 5 hours north to Romeo, Michigan to attend Kathy&#8217;s niece Lindsey&#8217;s wedding reception. The wedding was last year, but it was a small event with no reception because of Covid. The reception was a bright (and humid) &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2021\/08\/30\/our-trek-west-installment-one\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Our Trek West (Installment One)<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[13403,406,586,677,554707329],"tags":[554707977,24218731,554707978,554707973,554707980,554707979,1674,554707981],"class_list":["post-7709","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-camping","category-family","category-food","category-friends","category-traveling","tag-betsy","tag-family-2","tag-marilynn","tag-owosso","tag-romeo","tag-shiawassee","tag-wedding","tag-west"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7709","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=7709"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7709\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":7723,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7709\/revisions\/7723"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=7709"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=7709"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=7709"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}